# Coverage: full
# Message:
#   Fixed infinite looping bug with AI_heal. We now push a heal mission when we want to heal. AI_group will not join groups which have a heal activity. Every turn, when normally resetting group activities (CvSelectionGroup::doTurn), if we are isAutomated(), we reactivate groups which are set to heal, damaged or not. Previously, automated groups would never push heal missions. Now they can, knowing it will be cleared at the beginning of the next turn.
# Changed paths (2):
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvSelectionGroup.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnitAI.cpp

